import json
from pathlib import Path
from content_helper import case,rows
rows.clear()
case('P239','A_04131',['展示手套附近的火焰','观察戴手套的手保持或调整姿态，另一手操作按可见程度评价。','手套应随手运动，火焰与可见燃烧位置应有合理空间关系。','火焰可闪动，手套不必短时间内熔化或出现明显破损。','若手或火源移动，观察火焰连续变化，不推断不可见燃料与点火方法。','火源与手套关系不可辨认，无法评价实际交互时选择无法判断。','手部姿态、手套连续性与可见火焰来源'],['Display flames near a glove','Consider the gloved-hand posture and adjustments, assessing the other hand only where visible.','The glove should move with the hand and flames should have plausible spatial relations to visible burning locations.','Flames may flicker. Immediate glove melting or damage is not required.','On hand or source motion, consider continuous flame changes without inferring unseen fuel or ignition methods.','Choose unable to judge if flame–glove relations cannot be distinguished enough to assess actual interaction.','Hand posture, glove continuity, and visible flame sources'])
case('P240','A_03923',['持握锅内已有火焰的平底锅','观察握柄、手臂承托和可能的晃锅动作。','锅柄与锅体应连接连续，手或灶台应提供合理支撑。','锅内火焰可随气流和锅体运动变化，不要求重新点火、必定翻食材或锅体燃烧。','若锅移动或停住，观察火焰来源和运动变化，不把火焰大小单独当成合理性分数。','锅与手的实际关系被遮挡，无法评价持锅过程时选择无法判断。','人体控锅、锅体支撑与锅内火焰连续性'],['Hold a pan with existing flames inside','Consider handle grip, arm support, and any pan movement.','Handle–pan structure should remain continuous, supported plausibly by hand or stove.','Flames may respond to airflow and pan motion. New ignition, food tossing, or pan-material combustion is not required.','On moving or stopping, consider flame source and motion without treating flame size alone as plausibility.','Choose unable to judge if actual hand–pan relations are obscured enough to prevent assessment.','Pan control, pan support, and internal-flame continuity'])
case('P241','A_03883',['用长叉调整炉内壁上的面饼','观察握持长杆、前伸推压及身体平衡。','叉头、面饼和炉壁的接触应与手部动作相符。','面饼可局部压合或调整位置，不要求已有火焰重新点燃或面饼立刻熟透。','若工具退出，观察面饼对炉壁的附着和可见火焰，不强制要求面饼掉落。','炉口遮挡使实际工具面饼作用不足以评价时选择无法判断。','人体控叉、面饼炉壁接触与炉内支撑'],['Adjust flatbreads on an oven wall with a long fork','Consider long-shaft grip, reaching pressure, and balance.','Head, bread, and oven-wall contact should correspond to hand action.','Bread may press against the wall or shift locally. Reignition or immediate full cooking is not required.','On withdrawal, consider bread attachment and visible flames without requiring detachment.','Choose unable to judge if oven occlusion prevents assessment of actual tool–bread action.','Fork control, bread–wall contact, and oven support'])
case('P242','A_03796',['双手举持燃烧的香束','观察双手夹持、举降香束与身体俯仰的协调。','香束应随手连续运动，香枝和绑线关系应合理。','已有燃烧端可持续冒烟，不要求当场点火或每枝均有明火。','若香束下降或倾斜，观察烟气上升与扩散，不要求烟完全跟随香束刚体移动。','手与香束或烟源均无法辨认，实际交互不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手举降、香束承托与烟气运动'],['Raise and lower a bundle of burning incense','Consider two-hand grip, bundle lifting and lowering, and body bowing.','Incense should move continuously with the hands, maintaining plausible stick–binding relations.','Existing burning tips may smoke. New ignition or open flames on every stick is not required.','On lowering or tilting, consider smoke rise and dispersal rather than rigidly attaching all smoke to the bundle.','Choose unable to judge if hand–bundle relations or smoke sources cannot be distinguished enough for assessment.','Two-hand lifting, incense support, and smoke motion'])
case('P243','A_03765',['扶持连接软管的金属喷灯','观察握柄、手臂承托及喷嘴调向。','金属管、软管和手部的连接应连续，火焰应与喷嘴位置相关。','火焰可喷出并摆动，软管可弯曲，不要求金属管熔化或点燃其他物体。','若喷灯移动或停止，观察软管约束及火焰方向变化。','喷嘴或握持位置不可见，实际控灯关系不足以评价时选择无法判断。','人体控灯、软管约束与喷嘴火焰'],['Support a hose-connected metal torch','Consider grip, arm support, and nozzle orientation.','Pipe, hose, and hand connections should remain continuous, with flame related to nozzle position.','Flame may jet and fluctuate and the hose may bend. Pipe melting or ignition of another object is not required.','On movement or stopping, consider hose constraints and flame-direction changes.','Choose unable to judge if nozzle or grip visibility prevents assessment of actual torch control.','Torch control, hose constraints, and nozzle flame'])
case('P244','A_03722',['扶持并操作已有炭火的熏烤炉','观察手套对炉体或门体的扶持及上身平衡。','炉门、炉体和手的接触应连续，按可见操作评价，不预设一定开关门。','炉内炭火可闪动，不要求重新点火、金属炉体变形或整炉移动。','若门或手移开，观察铰接与支撑及火焰位置。','只有站在炉旁且实际手炉接触不足以评价时选择无法判断。','人体扶持、炉体门体连接与炉内炭火'],['Support and handle a smoker with existing coals','Consider gloved support of the body or door and upper-body balance.','Door, casing, and hand contact should remain continuous. Assess visible action without presuming a door cycle.','Coals may glow or flicker. New ignition, casing deformation, or whole-smoker movement is not required.','On door or hand movement, consider hinges, support, and flame locations.','Choose unable to judge if only standing beside the smoker is shown and actual contact cannot be assessed.','Body support, casing–door connections, and internal coals'])
case('P245','A_03693',['持握并观察圆柱形道具','观察手指握持、手腕定向与上身协调。','圆柱体应由手合理承托，顶部和下部结构应连续。','按实际可见情况评价顶部，持握任务不强制要求点火或冒烟。','若道具移动或出现火焰烟气，观察重力、握持及可见来源，不推断内部成分。','道具与手的实际承托关系无法辨认时选择无法判断。','手部握持、圆柱体连续性与可见顶部变化'],['Hold and observe a cylindrical prop','Consider finger grip, wrist orientation, and upper-body coordination.','The hand should plausibly support the cylinder, with continuous top and lower-body structure.','Assess the visible top. This holding task does not require ignition or smoke.','If moved or flames or smoke appear, consider gravity, grip, and visible sources without inferring contents.','Choose unable to judge if actual hand–prop support cannot be distinguished.','Hand grip, cylinder continuity, and visible top changes'])
case('P246','A_03662',['用打火机加热圆柱形电子元件','观察一手夹持元件、另一手控火与精细定位。','火焰应来源于打火机，元件与火焰的接近应与手部动作对应。','元件可以短时间没有明显外观变化，不要求熔化、爆裂或电学反应。','若打火机移开或熄灭，观察火源位置和夹持，不推断不可见温度。','实际火焰与元件接近关系不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手定位、元件承托与打火机火焰来源'],['Heat a cylindrical electronic component with a lighter','Consider one-hand component grip, other-hand flame control, and fine positioning.','Flame should originate at the lighter and approach should correspond to hand motion.','The component may show no immediate appearance change. Melting, bursting, or electrical response is not required.','On withdrawal or extinction, consider source position and grip without inferring unseen temperature.','Choose unable to judge if actual flame–component proximity cannot be assessed.','Two-hand positioning, component support, and lighter-flame source'])
case('P247','A_03175',['用刀叉切牛排','观察一手叉住肉、另一手持刀往复切动的协调。','刀刃接触与切口发展应相关，叉和砧板应提供合理固定。','熟肉可局部受压、切开并露出截面，不要求瞬间完全分离或大量流汁。','若肉块分离或被叉起，观察承托转换、柔性及砧板接触。','只有刀叉就位，实际切肉不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手刀叉控制、牛排切口与砧板支撑'],['Cut steak with a knife and fork','Consider fork stabilization and coordinated sawing with the knife.','Blade contact should relate to cut progression, with plausible fork and board restraint.','Cooked meat may compress and open to reveal a cut face. Immediate full separation or abundant juices is not required.','If a piece separates or lifts, consider support transfer, flexibility, and board contact.','Choose unable to judge if only utensil setup is shown and actual cutting cannot be assessed.','Two-hand utensil control, steak cutting, and board support'])
case('P248','A_02921',['用长刀切固定架上的火腿','观察持刀往复导向、另一手扶持及身体协调。','长刀刃与火腿的切面应对应，固定架应合理限制整腿移动。','火腿可形成薄片或局部切口，不要求整腿随刀移动或一次切断。','若肉片下垂或取下，观察柔性、重力与承托。','只有刀贴近肉面，实际切削不足以评价时选择无法判断。','人体控刀、火腿薄片形成与固定架支撑'],['Slice ham mounted in a stand with a long knife','Consider sawing guidance, other-hand support, and body coordination.','Blade contact should correspond to the cut surface, with the stand plausibly restraining the ham.','Thin slices or local cuts may form. Whole-ham movement or severing in one stroke is not required.','If a slice droops or is removed, consider flexibility, gravity, and support.','Choose unable to judge if only blade positioning is shown and actual slicing cannot be assessed.','Knife control, ham-slice formation, and stand support'])
case('P249','A_04534',['给西葫芦卷添加馅料或涂料','观察指尖或工具取料、扶卷与放置的协调。','馅料转移应与手或工具接触相关，卷体应由砧板或手承托。','软馅可涂开、附着或少量掉落，不要求西葫芦卷被切开或变成液体。','若放手或工具移开，观察馅料附着、卷体保持及碎屑落下。','只有展示食材或取料准备，实际添加不足以评价时选择无法判断。','手部取放、软馅转移与卷体承托'],['Add filling or spread to zucchini rolls','Consider fingertip or tool transfer, roll stabilization, and placement.','Filling transfer should relate to hand or tool contact, with rolls supported by board or hand.','Soft filling may spread, adhere, or shed small amounts. Cutting rolls or liquefaction is not required.','On release or tool withdrawal, consider adhesion, roll retention, and falling crumbs.','Choose unable to judge if only display or preparation is shown and actual addition cannot be assessed.','Hand transfer, soft-filling motion, and roll support'])
case('P250','A_02996',['用菜刀切葱','观察持刀手上下或前后切动与扶葱手调整的协调。','刀刃与葱及砧板的接触应和切段出现对应。','葱的细长叶茎可弯曲、切断或散成小段，不要求所有叶片同时断开。','若切段散开或刀抬起，观察砧板支撑及细长叶段的柔性。','只有摆刀准备，实际切葱不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手控刀扶葱、叶茎分离与砧板支撑'],['Chop a scallion with a kitchen knife','Consider cutting strokes and coordinated adjustments of the stabilizing hand.','Blade contact with scallion and board should correspond to new cut sections.','Slender leaves and stems may bend, separate, or scatter. All leaves need not sever together.','If pieces scatter or the knife lifts, consider board support and flexible leaf segments.','Choose unable to judge if only knife setup is shown and actual chopping cannot be assessed.','Knife–scallion hand coordination, stem separation, and board support'])
case('P251','A_02918',['在砧板上切青椒','观察持刀、扶椒和切动时的身体协调。','刀刃作用与椒皮椒肉的切口应相关，椒体应由手和砧板合理固定。','空腔青椒可局部压扁、切开或分成块，不要求像实心根茎一样断裂。','若椒块分开或籽落下，观察薄壁柔性及砧板承托，不要求每次落籽。','只有准备，实际刀椒作用不足以评价时选择无法判断。','人体控刀、青椒薄壁分离与砧板固定'],['Cut a green pepper on a board','Consider knife grip, pepper stabilization, and body coordination.','Blade action should relate to skin and flesh cuts, with plausible hand and board restraint.','A hollow pepper may compress locally, open, or separate into pieces. Solid-root-like fracture is not required.','If pieces separate or seeds fall, consider wall flexibility and board support without requiring seed fall.','Choose unable to judge if only preparation is shown and actual knife–pepper action cannot be assessed.','Knife control, pepper-wall separation, and board restraint'])
case('P252','A_02444',['在砧板上切红洋葱','观察持刀、扶葱和手指移位的协调。','刀刃接触应对应洋葱切口，砧板应合理承托。','洋葱可分成片块或散开层片，已有葱皮不代表当前切割成功。','若层片滑开或刀退出，观察局部支撑和重力，不要求葱皮全部脱落。','只有摆刀或整理洋葱，实际切割不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手切葱、洋葱层片变化与砧板支撑'],['Cut a red onion on a board','Consider knife control, onion stabilization, and finger repositioning.','Blade contact should correspond to cuts, with plausible board support.','The onion may separate into pieces or layers. Existing skins do not establish current cutting success.','If layers slide or the knife withdraws, consider local support and gravity without requiring complete peeling.','Choose unable to judge if only setup or handling is shown and actual cutting cannot be assessed.','Two-hand cutting, onion-layer changes, and board support'])
case('P253','A_01677',['用白色切片器按切黄瓜','观察扶持黄瓜、定位切片器与下压的双手配合。','切片器的实际刃口或切割区域应与黄瓜接触对应，不能把装饰孔都视作刀刃。','黄瓜可局部压缩、切开或分片，不要求整根同步改变。','若切片器抬起或片块散开，观察黄瓜与砧板支撑。','刃口作用被遮挡，实际按切不足以评价时选择无法判断。','手部下压、切片器黄瓜接触与切片支撑'],['Press a white slicer onto a cucumber','Consider cucumber stabilization, slicer positioning, and coordinated downward pressure.','Actual blade or cutting regions should correspond to cucumber contact. Do not treat every opening as a blade.','The cucumber may compress locally, cut, or separate into slices without whole-cucumber change.','On lifting or piece separation, consider cucumber and board support.','Choose unable to judge if blade action is obscured and actual slicing cannot be assessed.','Hand pressure, slicer–cucumber contact, and slice support'])
case('P254','A_01666',['用带收集盒的刨丝器刨胡萝卜','观察一手固定刨丝器、另一手往复送入胡萝卜的协调。','胡萝卜与金属刨面的摩擦方向应对应刨削，装置应得到合理承托。','胡萝卜可逐渐减少并形成细丝，盒内已有细丝不代表当前刨削成功。','若细丝落入盒内或食材抬起，观察重力和刨面分离，不要求盒被装满。','只有贴住刨面准备，实际刨削不足以评价时选择无法判断。','双手控料控刨、胡萝卜成丝与收集盒支撑'],['Grate carrot with a collection-box grater','Consider stabilizing the grater and reciprocating carrot feed.','Carrot motion against the metal surface should correspond to abrasion, with supported equipment.','Carrot may gradually reduce into shreds. Existing box contents do not establish current grating success.','If shreds enter the box or food lifts, consider gravity and separation without requiring a full box.','Choose unable to judge if only surface setup is shown and actual grating cannot be assessed.','Two-hand grater control, carrot-shred formation, and collection-box support'])
Path(__file__).with_name('batch_30.json').write_text(json.dumps(rows,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))
